003300     COPY DDS-MCRPCS0200  OF MCFLCS0201.
003400
003500 FD  DDAILYTC-DT-O
003600     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
003700 01  DDAILYTC-DT-REC-O.
003800     COPY DDS-MCRPCS1600  OF MCFLCS1601.
003900
004000 FD  DWLITEM-CD-I
004100     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
004200 01  DWLITEM-CD-REC-I.
004300     COPY DDS-MCRPCS1500  OF MCFLCS1502.

       FD  MPLTINFO
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

004500 FD  DISPLAY-FILE
004600     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
004700 01  DISPLAY-REC        PIC X(1500).
004800
