006100         10  FILLER OCCURS 6 TIMES.
006200             15  HOLD-BIN-LOC  PIC X(12).
006300             15  HOLD-BIN-QTY  PIC S9(8) BINARY.
006400
006500     05  HOLD-BIN-NO.
006600         10  FILLER       PIC X.
006700         10  H-BIN-NO     PIC S9.
006500     05  HOLD-BIN-NO-2.
006600         10  FILLER       PIC X.
006700         10  H-BIN-NO-2   PIC S9.
