011300     05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".
011400
011500 COPY DBSTAT     IN COPYLIB.
011600 01  DSET-NAMES.
011700     05  DSET-MSTORERM             PIC X(16) VALUE "MSTORERM;".
011800     05  DSET-DWLITEM              PIC X(16) VALUE "DWLITEM;".
